{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#card-zh","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut 是一个面向 DSH Web 的 Windows 桌面快捷方式插件，通过注册 /desktop-shortcut 命令生成启动批处理文件和桌面 .lnk 文件。启动器会检查配置端口是否已有服务：已运行时打开配置 URL，未运行时执行配置的启动命令并等待服务就绪。用户可设置快捷方式名称、URL、端口、图标、工作目录、启动命令和等待时长，也可从用户图标或内置图标选择快捷方式图标。适合希望从 Windows 桌面一键启动或重新打开本地 DSH Web 的用户；需要 Windows 和 Node.js 18 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:80-121","lib/index.js:154-224","cordis.patch.yml:13-24"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#card-en","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut adds a /desktop-shortcut command for Windows DSH Web. It creates a desktop link and batch launcher, which opens an existing service or starts it and waits for readiness. Configure the URL, port, command, paths, wait time, and icon. Requires Windows and Node.js 18+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:80-121","lib/index.js:154-224","cordis.patch.yml:13-24"]}
