{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#feature-1","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut 的功能「桌面快捷方式」：在 DSH 命令中运行 /desktop-shortcut，插件会生成启动批处理文件并在 Windows 桌面创建指向它的 .lnk 快捷方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-187","lib/index.js:217-224"]}
