{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#feature-3","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut 的功能「自定义启动项」：管理员可配置快捷方式名称、访问 URL、检测端口、启动命令、工作目录和等待秒数，生成的启动脚本按这些值运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-48","lib/index.js:80-121"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#feature-4","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut 的功能「选择快捷方式图标」：创建快捷方式时优先使用配置的图标路径，其次查找启动目录中的首个 ico 或 png 文件，最后回退到随包提供的图标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:124-151","lib/index.js:164-180"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-shortcut#caveat-1","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-shortcut","commit":"567c036c8c2eef343e6d0c4c3c80ec470d593426","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-shortcut 使用前须知：该命令仅支持 Windows；其他平台会返回错误。它会在启动目录写入 start-dsh.bat，并在桌面创建快捷方式。（见 lib/index.js:154-166）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-166"]}
